  "summary": {
    "text": "Nemotron 3 Nano Omni is an open-weights multimodal reasoning model in NVIDIA's Nemotron 3 family that takes video, audio, images and text and produces text. It pairs the Nemotron 3 Nano 30B-A3B language model with vision and speech encoders; NVIDIA positions it as the perception sub-agent in agent systems and offered it as a download, on build.nvidia.com and via partners.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "src.nvidia.nemotron-3-nano-omni-blog"
