  "notes": "The released checkpoints carry the suffix 30B-A3B-Reasoning; the model card gives Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni-30B-A3B-Reasoning as the model version, and its build.nvidia.com path is the same name in lower case (nemotron-3-nano-omni-30b-a3b-reasoning), so it is not listed as a separate alias. NVIDIA says Omni extends the Nemotron 3 family into multimodal and agentic domains. The model card says it was improved using several Qwen models and gpt-oss-120b (training data), which is not recorded as a relation. English only per the model card."
